  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 4 NGO Educational Center for Human Rights in Lviv</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to bridge the gap between awareness and action, empowering Ukrainians to become active participants in the fight against corruption. The project seeks to address corruption in Ukraine by leveraging an innovative and accessible format: a true crime podcast based on journalistic investigations. The podcast will serve as a tool to bridge the gap between awareness and action, empowering Ukrainians to actively participate in anti-corruption efforts. By utilizing storytelling and investigative journalism, the podcast will make the concept of zero tolerance for corruption a shared societal norm. It will equip listeners with practical knowledge on how to respond to corruption and inspire a culture of integrity and accountability</narrative>
  </description>
